WEBVTT

00:02:59.771 --> 00:03:03.016
As long as you committed
to hard work and intelligence,

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.566
that was enough to make
an impact in the world.

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:07.607
And this was something,
for me, personally,

00:03:07.631 --> 00:03:09.947
that I had to believe in my life,

00:03:09.971 --> 00:03:13.465
because it was one of the few
anchors that I had had

00:03:13.489 --> 00:03:15.011
that got me through the day.

00:03:15.582 --> 00:03:17.003
So you can imagine,

00:03:17.027 --> 00:03:21.638
when I received this letter,
I was so excited.

00:03:21.662 --> 00:03:24.010
I was over the moon.

00:03:24.034 --> 00:03:28.392
This was finally my opportunity
to contribute to society,

00:03:28.416 --> 00:03:31.589
to solve the problems
that I had seen in the world,